WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/analytics/pages/MileagePage.tsx — route /mileage. A PageContainer with:
    • header: title `mileage.title` + subtitle `mileage.subtitle` + actions (VehicleSelect + DataFreshnessAuto).
    • a load-failure AlertBanner on `anyError` (statsError | dailyError | monthlyError).
    • four MetricCards (Total Distance / Total Drives / Daily Avg 30d / Annual Projection), 4 skeletons while isLoading.
    • GlassPanel "Odometer Over Time" → Recharts AreaChart over days with end_odometer_km != null (EmptyState else).
    • GlassPanel "Daily Distance" → Recharts BarChart over daily total_km (EmptyState else).
    • GlassPanel "Monthly Summary" → DataTable [Month, Distance (unit), Drives, Distance per Drive (unit)].
  Data sources (cache-then-network, SI on the wire — km):
    useMileageStats → GET /mileage/stats[vehicle_id]; useDailyMileage → GET /mileage/daily[vehicle_id,days=90];
    useMonthlyMileage → GET /mileage/monthly[vehicle_id]. Distance converted km→display via convertDistanceFromSI.

